# The one variable the PostgreSQL test tier reads. Nothing in this package loads
# this file: it is a template to copy and export from, or a note of what to set.
#
# Point the value at a scratch database you are willing to drop. The event log is
# append-only, so the tier never cleans up after itself, and both migrations have
# to be applied first. tests/integration/README.md carries the commands.
MENU_EVENTS_TEST_DSN=
